OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FGenerally dry and fine, with
OL,6,Fgood spells of sunshine. There may be
OL,7,Fsome infrequent, and mainly light
OL,8,Fshowers at times during the morning.
OL,9,FBlustery westerly winds during the
OL,10,Fmorning, particularly along the coast,
OL,11,Feasing through the late afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FStaying dry through the
OL,14,Fevening with high cloud and some
OL,15,Fclearer skies giving some hazy evening
OL,16,Fsunshine. Winds becoming light.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FDry and bright to start,
OL,19,Fthough quickly clouding over as a band
OL,20,Fof rain moves in from the west by mid-
OL,21,Fmorning. Blustery winds developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
